<Text>% RF system parameters&#x000D;&#x000A;RF_Freq = 320e6;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Frequency divide by N factor&#x000D;&#x000A;DivN = 8;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Phase Lock Loop design parameters&#x000D;&#x000A;% Closed loop bandwidth in Hz&#x000D;&#x000A;BW = 100; &#x000D;&#x000A;% NormalizedZero;&#x000D;&#x000A;NZ = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;% DampingFactor ;&#x000D;&#x000A;DF = 1/sqrt(2);&#x000D;&#x000A;% Phase detector gain constant, volts/deg&#x000D;&#x000A;PDGC = 0.1*pi/180;&#x000D;&#x000A;% VCO tuning sensitivity, Hz/volt&#x000D;&#x000A;KV = BW;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Simulation parameters&#x000D;&#x000A;TStep = 1/BW/50; &#x000D;&#x000A;SR = 1/ TStep;&#x000D;&#x000A;NPts = 2^12;&#x000D;&#x000A;TStop = (NPts-1)*TStep;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;%********** Do not change below this line *********************&#x000D;&#x000A;%         Derived phase lock loop factors&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% VCO tuning sensitivity, (rad/sec)/volt&#x000D;&#x000A;KV_rad = 2*pi*KV;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Phase detector gain constant, volts/radian&#x000D;&#x000A;PDGC_rad = PDGC*180/pi;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Loop gain external to the loop filter&#x000D;&#x000A;ExtG = PDGC_rad*KV_rad/DivN;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;A = 1 + 1/NZ^2 - 2*DF^2;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Loop natural frequency in radians/sec&#x000D;&#x000A;wn = 2*pi*BW/sqrt(A +sqrt(A^2+1));&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Closed loop noise bandwidth, Hz&#x000D;&#x000A;BWn = wn*( wn^2/(NZ*wn) + (NZ*wn) )/8/(NZ*wn)/DF;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% FP, closed loop frequency for maximum gain, Hz&#x000D;&#x000A;FP = sqrt( -1 + sqrt(1 +(A+1-2*DF^2)/NZ^2))*(NZ*wn)/2/pi;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% preliminary factors&#x000D;&#x000A;phi1 = pi - atan( sqrt(1-DF^2)/(NZ-DF));&#x000D;&#x000A;phi2 = atan( sqrt(1-DF^2)/(NZ-DF))-atan( sqrt(1-DF^2)/(-DF));&#x000D;&#x000A;D = sqrt( (wn^2 - (2*pi*FP)^2)^2 + (4*DF*wn*pi*FP)^2 );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% AP, maximum closed loop gain at frequency FP&#x000D;&#x000A;temp1 = sqrt( 1+(2*pi*FP/(NZ*wn))^2 );&#x000D;&#x000A;temp2 = wn^2/D;&#x000D;&#x000A;AP = wn^2*sqrt( 1+(2*pi*FP/(NZ*wn))^2 )/D;&#x000D;&#x000A;AP_dB = 20*log10(AP);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Step response percent overshoot&#x000D;&#x000A;PO = 100*sqrt(1+1/NZ^2-2*DF/NZ)*exp(-DF*phi1/sqrt(1-DF^2));&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Step response time to maximum overshoot&#x000D;&#x000A;Tmax = (pi+asin(1-DF^2) - phi2 )/(sqrt(1-DF^2));&#x000D;&#x000A;Tmax = Tmax/wn;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
<UnitUse><T>Int</T><D>2</D></UnitUse>
